# Raw LIKWID / validation intermediate captures (results/).
# These are NOT read by any python_plot/ script — they are consolidated into
# results/validation_summary.md, which the plots use. Archived out-of-repo as
# ~/fhe_results_raw_captures_*.tar.gz for provenance. Do not commit them.
# NOTE: prefix-scoped on purpose so tracked plot inputs (rss_expansion_results.json,
# shuffle_mode_compare.json, etc.) are never matched.
results/reval_*
results/rss_expansion_remeasure_*
results/shuffle_mode_reval_*
results/verify_seq_add_*
results/wholeproc_seq_add_*
results/wpdiff_seq_add_*
